        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Blackfang108\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Blackfang108:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Maggie wrote:</b><br><blockquote>@Blackfang yes! I will be writing a transcript of the questions. It may take a few days to go up because we have A LOT of questions, but I won't everyone to be able to get this information in the format that's best for them.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;Hi Maggie, how's that transcript coming?&nbsp; I understnd it's not necessarily the highest priority, but I prefer reading to watching.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you didn't see it already elsewhere its out now. <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QtJ8vLuNjNflO5xBkiR3LiU0BMIrSMU9ep_D1EDR-54/edit\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Here.</a></p>",
